WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.750
This module has no Lab 2 of its own.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.667
The real test-instance run
is Chapter 10's Stage 1,

3
00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:09.303
and it wasn't run by the authors:
every command has run only as

4
00:00:09.303 --> 00:00:13.012
a dry run on the kit's example
settings and in its Pester tests.

5
00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:17.237
You need a test instance in Arc-eligibility
Category 1, never production;

6
00:00:17.237 --> 00:00:21.391
a deployer activated under pim for
the change window only; Reader on the

7
00:00:21.391 --> 00:00:25.475
subscriptions to read Arc; and the
tools signed in to commercial Azure.

8
00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:29.773
You also need a filled test settings
file with no secret, a reviewed mapping,

9
00:00:29.773 --> 00:00:32.684
the exception registry with
the break-glass group,

10
00:00:32.684 --> 00:00:35.387
and a second person to
approve the three hashes.

11
00:00:35.387 --> 00:00:38.166
The run is Lab 1's steps
against your test instance,

12
00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:41.960
with the apply switch on the create
and the cutover, the parallel run

13
00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:46.025
and thirty days of observation, then
a seal without the rehearsal switch.

14
00:00:46.025 --> 00:00:49.014
To back it out, run the
approved rollback with apply,

15
00:00:49.014 --> 00:00:52.075
under its own change record
and in its own run folder.

16
00:00:52.075 --> 00:00:56.830
Run the test stage first, read every
file you approve, and keep the evidence.
